(text "SOT-89 pinout: 1 GND, 2 VIN (tab), 3 VOUT.\nUse HT7333-1, not the 12 V HT7333 / 73xx-A part. Confirm exact orderable part before BOM release.\n10 uF + 100 nF at input/output per Holtek application circuit; allow for DC-bias derating.\nCheck LDO dissipation: (VIN - 3.3 V) x ILOGIC. The 250 mA headline is not a thermal allowance." (at 25.4000 142.2400 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c2028269-a90f-5307-9cb0-1c9de3e816fc"))
